  "code": "def predict(tokens, prompt):\n    # Order read off E0001: bo(1) < nu(4) < pa(5) < la(3) < ri(6) < vu(7)\n    rank = {1: 0, 4: 1, 5: 2, 3: 3, 6: 4, 7: 5}\n    seq = [int(t) for t in tokens[1:]]  # drop BOS\n    # mlp0 -> mlp1 -> 2.0 -> mlp2: every position gets its rank among the 5 symbols (E0009, E0018)\n    # 3.1 at the last position attends to the lowest-ranked position and copies its symbol to the logits (E0008, E0016)\n    return min(seq, key=lambda t: rank[t])\n",
